  <head>
    <ce:title>Critical temperature, upper critical magnetic field, and pinning parameters of cuprate and pnictide superconductors</ce:title>
    <ce:abstract>
      <ce:simple-para>High-temperature superconductivity enables lossless electrical transport. Here, we assemble elemental stoichiometries and superconducting critical parameters including critical temperature (Tc), upper critical field (Hc2), and critical current density (Jc).</ce:simple-para>
    </ce:abstract>
  </head>
  <body>
    <ce:sections>
      <ce:section>
